{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"compression-ratio-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"no","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"nb-NO","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Det statiske forholdet er (sveipvolum + klaringsvolum) ÷ klaringsvolum. Sveipvolum kommer fra borehull og slaglengde. klaring kombinerer kammer, topppakning, dekk og stempelkronevolumer. Et ZXQPH0000QXZ cc sveipvolum og ZXQPH0001QXZ cc klaringsvolum gir ZXQPH0002QXZ: ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"ad1447806a3f0dfac0e84bbca4ec5d7b4e3aa8bb7a20f1731bf137584a5fd399","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.032056007750043,"source":"The static ratio is (swept volume + clearance volume) ÷ clearance volume. Swept volume comes from bore and stroke. Clearance combines chamber, head-gasket, deck and piston-crown volumes. A 9 cc swept volume and 1 cc clearance volume give 10:1.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"7f1b9a876212f35745c97510b1a02f7994170aa52b4d60a12f7357c7e2398c83","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Det statiske forholdet er (sveipvolum + klaringsvolum) ÷ klaringsvolum. Sveipvolum kommer fra borehull og slaglengde. klaring kombinerer kammer, topppakning, dekk og stempelkronevolumer. Et 9 cc sveipvolum og 1 cc klaringsvolum gir 10: 1.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
